#. module: spreadsheet_public_share_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:spreadsheet_public_share_oca.field_spreadsheet_public_share__spreadsheet_id
msgid ""
"Spreadsheet whose read-only preview is exposed at the public URL. You can "
"only share a spreadsheet you are allowed to edit (its owner, a contributor "
"or a Spreadsheet manager), because the link publishes it to anyone who has "
"the URL."
msgstr ""
"Spreadsheet waarvan het alleen-lezen voorbeeld op de publieke URL wordt "
"getoond. U kunt alleen een spreadsheet delen die u mag bewerken (eigenaar, "
"bijdrager of Spreadsheet-manager), omdat de link hem publiceert voor "
"iedereen die de URL heeft."

#. module: spreadsheet_public_share_oca
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spreadsheet_public_share_oca.public_share_view_form
