msgstr "Statistieken"

#. module: spreadsheet_public_share_oca
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_public_share_oca/controllers/main.py:0
msgid ""
"The data of this spreadsheet could not be read, so it cannot be downloaded "
"right now. Please tell the person who shared this link, so they can open the"
" spreadsheet in Odoo and save it again."
msgstr ""
"De gegevens van deze spreadsheet konden niet worden gelezen, daarom kan hij "
"nu niet worden gedownload. Laat het de persoon weten die deze link heeft "
"gedeeld, zodat die de spreadsheet in Odoo kan openen en opnieuw kan opslaan."

#. module: spreadsheet_public_share_oca
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spreadsheet_public_share_oca.public_share_view_form
msgid "The old link will stop working. Continue?"
msgstr "De oude link werkt dan niet meer. Doorgaan?"

#. module: spreadsheet_public_share_oca
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_public_share_oca/models/public_share.py:0
msgid ""
"The password of the share link '%(name)s' is too long (%(length)s "
"characters). Very long passwords make every access check slow for the "
"server. Choose a password of at most %(max)s characters."
msgstr ""
"Het wachtwoord van de deellink '%(name)s' is te lang (%(length)s tekens). "
"Zeer lange wachtwoorden maken elke toegangscontrole traag voor de server. "
"Kies een wachtwoord van maximaal %(max)s tekens."

#. module: spreadsheet_public_share_oca
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_public_share_oca/models/public_share.py:0
